    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Dashboard 2'>
      <style />
      <size sizing-mode='automatic' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='98110' id='8' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98500' x='750' y='945'>
            <zone h='98110' id='3' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='79100' x='750' y='945'>
              <zone fixed-size='352' h='42503' id='6' is-fixed='true' name='Correlación turismo' w='79100' x='750' y='945'>
                <layout-cache minheight='198' minwidth='159' type-h='scalable' type-w='scalable' />
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone fixed-size='438' h='51712' id='11' is-fixed='true' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='79100' x='750' y='43448'>
                <zone fixed-size='162' h='20071' id='12' is-fixed='true' name='Perfiles competencia' w='79100' x='750' y='43448'>
                  <layout-cache fixed-size-w='835' type-h='fixed' type-w='fixed' />
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='245' forceUpdate='true' h='29871' id='14' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='79100' x='750' y='63519'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Hypothesis confirmed with nuances:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> higher visitor volumes correlate with better sentiment. The years 2023–2024 (tourism peak) coincide with better perception in 3 out of 4 venues.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Key finding for show design:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> seasonality matters more than venue. November–February averages +0.848 sentiment vs +0.353 in September. The same show receives radically different perceptions depending on the month.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Most surprising finding:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> The Theater (Fairmont) has the most ambitious combination in the market and yet the lowest rating and highest variance. The gap between artistic ambition and customer perception is the most actionable insight in the dataset.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Conclusion:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> it matters less </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' italic='true'>where</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> you see the show than </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' italic='true'>when</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>. The month affects perception more than the venue itself.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Dashboard 1:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> Sentiment x venue shows La Perle&apos;s volatility and Fairmont&apos;s gradual improvement — consistent with the conclusions. Ratings x venue shows Dream Dubai as all dark blue (all 5 stars, small sample) and Fairmont with more dispersion — consistent. Reviews vs Tourism shows the volume peak in 2023–2024 coinciding with the tourism peak — consistent.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Dashboard 2:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> The scatter clearly shows Billionaire&apos;s sentiment rising as visitor numbers increase (from ~9M to ~14M) — consistent with the central hypothesis. Profiles shows La Perle as the only standalone/neutral venue against the three dinner-shows/suggestive — consistent with the competitive analysis.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
            </zone>
            <zone fixed-size='207' h='98110' id='7' is-fixed='true' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='19400' x='79850' y='945'>
              <zone h='12515' id='9' name='Correlación turismo' pane-specification-id='0' param='[federated.0fv3bg9186fxbi13tw7c01q8nh8m].[none:venue_name:nk]' type-v2='color' w='19400' x='79850' y='945'>
