                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Dashboard 2:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> The scatter clearly shows Billionaire&apos;s sentiment rising as visitor numbers increase (from ~9M to ~14M) — consistent with the central hypothesis. Profiles shows La Perle as the only standalone/neutral venue against the three dinner-shows/suggestive — consistent with the competitive analysis.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
